@startuml
title UC-H03 - View Hub Status
autonumber

actor Student
boundary "Hub Details Page" as UI
control "Hub Status Controller" as HSC
database "Hub Database" as HubDB
database "Vehicle Database" as VehicleDB
database "Parking Database" as ParkingDB
database "Charging Point Database" as ChargingDB

Student -> UI: Select a Mobility Hub
UI -> HSC: getHubStatus(hubId)

HSC -> HubDB: getHubDetails(hubId)
HubDB --> HSC: Hub details and operational status

HSC -> VehicleDB: getVehicleAvailability(hubId)
VehicleDB --> HSC: Vehicle availability and battery status

HSC -> ParkingDB: getParkingStatus(hubId)
ParkingDB --> HSC: Occupied spaces and total capacity

HSC -> ChargingDB: getChargingPointStatus(hubId)
ChargingDB --> HSC: Charging-point availability

HSC -> HSC: Compile Hub status
HSC -> HSC: Generate data timestamp/freshness indicator

alt All required data retrieved
    HSC --> UI: Hub status and freshness information
    UI --> Student: Display complete Hub status

else Some data unavailable
    HSC --> UI: Available status + unavailable fields
    UI --> Student: Display available data\nand mark missing information

else Hub status cannot be retrieved
    HSC --> UI: Status retrieval failure
    UI --> Student: Display status unavailable\nand offer retry
end

opt Availability changes while viewing
    Student -> UI: Refresh Hub status
    UI -> HSC: getHubStatus(hubId)
    HSC -> HubDB: Get latest Hub status
    HubDB --> HSC: Latest status
    HSC -> VehicleDB: Get latest vehicle availability
    VehicleDB --> HSC: Latest vehicle status
    HSC -> ParkingDB: Get latest parking status
    ParkingDB --> HSC: Latest parking status
    HSC -> ChargingDB: Get latest charging status
    ChargingDB --> HSC: Latest charging status
    HSC --> UI: Updated status and timestamp
    UI --> Student: Display refreshed information
end

@enduml